In this folder you will find different files:
- Figures.ipnyb: Python notebook to build the figures and preprocess the data
- Regression.R: R file to compute the poisson model to calculate RR 
- Synth_controls.R: R file to compute the synthetic control approach
- population_data.xlsx: Data gathered on the population for the different regions (not accurate)
- dades.xlsx: Data we used for the analyses
- admissionsED.xlsx: Data only for admissions from ED, used for the R codes
- attendancesED.xlsx: Data only for attendances at ED, used for the R codes
